        "html": "<article class='gated-page' data-companion-context='contact' data-companion-copy='No submission endpoint or approved public mailbox is configured. Contact fields are disabled and nothing entered here is stored or sent.' data-companion-reaction='contact'><nav class='detail-breadcrumb' aria-label='Breadcrumb'><a href='/'>Home</a><span aria-hidden='true'>/</span><span>Contact & feedback</span></nav><section class='gated-hero'><div class='gated-hero-copy'><p class='section-kicker'>CONTACT & FEEDBACK</p><span class='chip status-chip--coming'>NO APPROVED DESTINATION</span><h1>Contact routing is prepared, not connected</h1><p class='gated-lede'>The form structure is ready for an approved contact endpoint or public mailbox. Until one exists, every field and submission control is disabled; no personal information can be entered, stored, or sent here.</p></div><figure class='gated-hero-art'><img src='/assets/images/characters/companion/runtime-v2/contact.webp' alt='Toadal with a contact or message theme' loading='eager' decoding='async'></figure></section><section class='gated-split'><form class='gated-form' aria-describedby='contact-form-status'><div class='gated-field'><label for='contact-category'>Category</label><select id='contact-category' name='category' disabled><option>General feedback</option><option>Website support</option><option>Business / press</option><option>Privacy question</option></select></div><div class='gated-field'><label for='contact-email'>Email</label><input id='contact-email' name='email' type='email' autocomplete='off' disabled></div><div class='gated-field gated-field--wide'><label for='contact-subject'>Subject</label><input id='contact-subject' name='subject' type='text' disabled></div><div class='gated-field gated-field--wide'><label for='contact-message'>Message</label><textarea id='contact-message' name='message' rows='6' disabled></textarea></div><div class='gated-field gated-field--wide'><label for='contact-diagnostics'><input id='contact-diagnostics' name='diagnostics' type='checkbox' disabled> Include device and browser diagnostics (unavailable)</label></div><div class='gated-field gated-field--wide'><label for='contact-attachment'>Attachment</label><input id='contact-attachment' name='attachment' type='file' disabled></div><p class='gated-form-status' id='contact-form-status' role='status'>No submission endpoint or verified public mailbox is configured. All fields are disabled. Nothing entered here is sent anywhere. Nothing is stored or sent. Nothing is entered, stored, or sent here.</p><button class='button-link button-link--primary' type='submit' disabled>Submit unavailable</button></form><aside class='gated-side-stack'><article class='gated-card' data-companion-context='support'><p class='section-kicker'>SUPPORT</p><h2>Find help on the site</h2><p>Read guidance about guest progress and the current website preview.</p><a href='/support/'>Open Support</a></article><article class='gated-card' data-companion-context='business'><p class='section-kicker'>BUSINESS / PRESS</p><h2>No public business inbox is configured</h2><p>Business and press requests cannot be submitted until an approved destination is published.</p><a href='/about/'>About TOADAL GAMES</a></article><article class='gated-card' data-companion-context='privacy'><p class='section-kicker'>PRIVACY</p><h2>Legal source status</h2><p>Approved legal text and privacy contact details are not published.</p><a href='/legal/'>View Legal status</a></article><article class='gated-card' data-companion-context='under-construction'><p class='section-kicker'>WHY UNAVAILABLE</p><h2>No dead end</h2><p>The contact service stays unavailable until a real destination is approved.</p><a href='/coming-soon/'>See the construction guide</a></article></aside></section><aside class='toadal-companion' data-companion data-zone='hero' aria-label='Toadal contextual helper'><div class='companion-panel' id='toadal-companion-panel' data-companion-panel><p class='companion-label'>TOADAL SAYS</p><p class='companion-message' data-companion-speech aria-live='polite' aria-atomic='true'>No submission endpoint or approved public mailbox is configured. Contact fields are disabled and nothing entered here is stored or sent.</p></div><button class='companion-toggle' type='button' data-companion-toggle aria-controls='toadal-companion-panel' aria-expanded='true' aria-label='Minimize Toadal helper'><img class='companion-image' data-companion-image src='/assets/images/characters/toadal-victory.png' alt='' width='611' height='640' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><span class='sr-only'>Minimize Toadal helper</span></button></aside></article>"
